  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduction to Waypipe</title>

    <para>
      The Waypipe package provides network transparency for Wayland and goes
      through SSH.
    </para>

    &build-use-network;

    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download: <ulink url="&waypipe-download;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

<!--
    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Additional Downloads</bridgehead>
